 page('contact/','Contact Zawatu','hello@zawatu.com. Bancobu Ikirezi, new building, 5th floor, Burundi.',hero('LET’S TALK','Tell us where<br><em>you want to go.</em>','A campaign, a partnership or a story worth sharing? Start with your objective.')+f'<section class="section wrap"><div class="contact-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">SAY HELLO</span><a class="big-email" href="mailto:{e(S["email"])}">{e(S["email"])}</a><div class="office-box"><span class="eyebrow">VISIT BY ARRANGEMENT</span><p>Bancobu Ikirezi<br>New building, 5th floor<br>Burundi</p></div><div class="social-icons">{socials()}</div>{"<p class=fine>Social profiles will appear here when their verified links are supplied.</p>" if not socials() else ""}</div><div><h2>What are you<br><em>working towards?</em></h2><p>Tell us about your business, target audience, timeline and indicative budget. We will discuss the right scope for your project.</p><a class="solid" href="mailto:{e(S["email"])}?subject=Project%20enquiry">Email your project ↗</a><p>{a("consultation/","Prefer a focused consultation? ↗","text-link")}</p><div class="faq"><details><summary>Do you work internationally?</summary><p>We welcome relevant opportunities across borders. Geography, language and delivery arrangements are agreed for each project.</p></details><details><summary>Do you guarantee viral reach or sales?</summary><p>No. We agree the work and placements we control and report observed results with their limitations.</p></details></div></div></div></section>')
 page('transparency/','Transparency & privacy','Our approach to publishing, privacy and commercial collaboration.',hero('TRANSPARENCY','A clear basis<br><em>for trust.</em>','Useful content, identifiable commercial relationships and clear handling of requests.')+f'<section class="section wrap"><div class="prose"><h2>This presentation</h2><p>Zawatu presents media, marketing, PR and commercial partnership services, alongside a separately scoped technical consulting offer with Elvis Ndayishimiye. Campaign studies are illustrative. No clients, testimonials or outcomes are invented. Complete legal contracting details are provided with a proposal and remain to be added to this website.</p><h2>Contact and office</h2><p>{e(S["address"])}. Contact: {e(S["email"])}.</p><h2>Forms and appointments</h2><p>Appointment requests prepare an email draft in your browser. You review and send it through your mail service. This website does not store form data, reserve appointments or collect payments. Business consultation requests go to hello@zawatu.com; technical inquiries go to elvis@zawatu.com. Payment instructions and applicable terms are agreed by email. The business scheduling link is sent manually after payment verification; Calendly processes bookings under its own terms. Inquiry information is used to assess and respond to your request, not to subscribe you to marketing. Contact us to request correction or deletion, subject to any applicable record-retention obligations.</p><h2>Editorial and sponsorship</h2><p>Sponsored content will be identified. No advertising or affiliate tracking programme is active in this release.</p><h2>Technical access and rights</h2><p>No analytics or advertising scripts are included. The host may process technical access data. Contact us for corrections or permission to reuse content.</p></div></section>')
